{
  "info": {
    "name": "Ticketing Platform",
    "description": "Flujos principales de la plataforma de ticketing (RFC-001 §10.1). Ejecutar con el entorno local.postman_environment.json contra docker compose up. Los flujos 2 y 5 requieren cambiar la configuración del worker o de la API como indica su descripción.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Venta aprobada",
      "description": "Reserva, procesamiento asíncrono y venta. El worker debe estar con PAYMENT_SIMULATOR_MODE=APPROVE.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear evento (10 entradas)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/events",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "events"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Venta aprobada\",\n  \"venue\": {\n    \"name\": \"Movistar Arena\",\n    \"city\": \"Bogota\"\n  },\n  \"date\": \"{{eventDate}}\",\n  \"capacity\": 10\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"201 Created con TKS0002\", () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().meta.code).to.eql(\"TKS0002\");",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"eventSale\", pm.response.json().data.eventId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Comprar 2 entradas",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{keySale}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{customerToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "orders"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"eventId\": \"{{eventSale}}\",\n  \"quantity\": 2\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"keySale\", pm.variables.replaceIn(\"{{$guid}}\"));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"202\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "pm.test(\"Orden RESERVED con TKS0003\", () => {",
                  "  const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(b.meta.code).to.eql(\"TKS0003\");",
                  "  pm.expect(b.data.status).to.eql(\"RESERVED\");",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"orderSale\", pm.response.json().data.orderId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Disponibilidad tras reservar (2 apartadas)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventSale}}/availability",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "events",
                "{{eventSale}}",
                "availability"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"Contadores\", () => {",
                  "  const d = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "",
                  "  pm.expect(d.available + d.reserved + d.sold + d.complimentary).to.eql(d.capacity);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar orden (SOLD tras el procesamiento)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{customerToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderSale}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "orders",
                "{{orderSale}}"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "setTimeout(() => {}, 4000);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"Orden SOLD\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.status).to.eql(\"SOLD\"));",
                  "pm.test(\"Entradas SOLD\", () => pm.response.json().data.tickets.forEach(t => pm.expect(t.status).to.eql(\"SOLD\")));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Disponibilidad final: 8 disponibles, 2 vendidas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventSale}}/availability",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "events",
                "{{eventSale}}",
                "availability"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"Contadores\", () => {",
                  "  const d = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  pm.expect(d.available).to.eql(8);",
                  "  pm.expect(d.reserved).to.eql(0);",
                  "  pm.expect(d.sold).to.eql(2);",
                  "  pm.expect(d.complimentary).to.eql(0);",
                  "  pm.expect(d.available + d.reserved + d.sold + d.complimentary).to.eql(d.capacity);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Pago rechazado",
      "description": "Requiere recrear el worker con PAYMENT_SIMULATOR_MODE=DECLINE (ver deployment/README.md). La orden termina CANCELLED y las entradas vuelven a estar disponibles. Otros modos del simulador (README, Modos del simulador de pagos): APPROVE vende; RANDOM aprueba con PAYMENT_SIMULATOR_APPROVAL_RATE y repite la decisión para la misma orden; SLOW y DOWN fallan cada cobro con TKT0007, el mensaje llega a la DLQ y el barrido deja la orden EXPIRED al vencer. Con RANDOM, SLOW o DOWN las aserciones de este flujo no aplican.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear evento (5 entradas)",
